.TH "nvme_init_cross_ctrl_reset" 9 "nvme_init_cross_ctrl_reset" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_cross_ctrl_reset \- Initialize passthru command for Cross-Controller Reset
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_cross_ctrl_reset
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "__u16 icid "  ","
.BI "__u8 ciu "  ","
.BI "__u64 cirn "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "icid" 12
Impacted Controller ID (ICID)
.IP "ciu" 12
Controller Instance Uniquifier (CIU) of the Impacted Controller
.IP "cirn" 12
Controller Instance Random Number (CIRN) of the Impacted
Controller
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Cross-Controller Reset
command.
